# gradlew is a POSIX shell script; a CRLF checkout (the Windows default)
# breaks its shebang the moment it runs anywhere other than Windows -
# discovered when the backend Docker build failed with "./gradlew: not
# found" despite the file being present, because its interpreter line
# effectively read "#!/bin/sh\r". Force LF regardless of platform.
gradlew text eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
